        "description": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003ECelebrate an amazing teacher with our Thoughtful Teacher Appreciation Gift Box, a beautifully curated collection designed to say “Thank You” in the most memorable way. Filled with practical keepsakes and sweet treats, this gift box is the perfect way to recognize the dedication, patience, and impact of an exceptional educator.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThoughtfully packaged in our signature Giftsbysisi EcoBox, this gift set is ideal for Teacher Appreciation Week, end-of-term celebrations, graduations, birthdays, retirement gifts, and Christmas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhat’s Inside\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E🌸 Personalized “Thank You for Helping Me Grow” Mini Throw Pillow\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E☕ Best Teacher Ever Small White Mug\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E📒 Floral Hardcover Notebook/Journal\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E🍪 “One Smart Cookie” Danish shortcake\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E🧽 Sugar Body Scrub\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E🌼 Decorative Mini Potted Flower\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E💌 Teacher Appreciation Greeting Card\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E🎁 Beautifully arranged in our eco-friendly signature gift box\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerfect for teachers, tutors, lecturers, professors, daycare providers, and mentors who deserve to feel appreciated.\u003C/p\u003E",
