        "sku": "",
        "short_description": "\u003Cp\u003ESay thank you with a personalized “Thank You for Helping Me Grow” Teacher Mug. This custom double-sided ceramic mug is the perfect teacher appreciation gift for Teacher Appreciation Week, end-of-year celebrations, birthdays, retirements, and Christmas.\u003C/p\u003E",
        "description": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003EShow your heartfelt appreciation with the Personalized “Thank You for Helping Me Grow” Teacher Mug, a thoughtful keepsake designed to celebrate the teachers who nurture, inspire, and help students flourish. Featuring a beautiful floral-themed design and personalized with your teacher’s name, this elegant double-sided ceramic mug makes every coffee or tea break extra special.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhether it’s for Teacher Appreciation Week, the end of the school year, a birthday, Christmas, or a retirement celebration, this personalized mug is a meaningful gift they’ll treasure and use every day.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrinted on both sides with vibrant, long-lasting colors, this mug combines practicality with heartfelt sentiment, making it the perfect thank-you gift for teachers of all ages and grade levels.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFeatures\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPersonalized with your teacher’s name\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EDouble-sided custom design\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EHigh-quality ceramic mug\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EDurable, vibrant, fade-resistant print\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EComfortable easy-grip handle\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EIdeal for coffee, tea, hot chocolate, and other beverages\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBeautiful floral-themed artwork\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPerfect for everyday use at home or in the classroom\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerfect For\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ETeacher Appreciation Week\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEnd-of-Year Teacher Gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBirthday Gifts for Teachers\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EChristmas Gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ERetirement Gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPreschool Teachers\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ENursery School Teachers\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPrimary &amp; Secondary School Teachers\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ECollege &amp; University Lecturers\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ESchool Administrators\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis personalized mug is more than a gift—it’s a daily reminder of the lasting impact teachers have on every student’s journey.\u003C/p\u003E",
