        "short_description": "\u003Cp\u003EExecutive men’s gift set featuring a stylish belt, elegant pen, and classic handkerchief. A thoughtful gift for birthdays, Father’s Day, corporate events, anniversaries, retirement, and special occasions.\u003C/p\u003E",
        "description": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003ELooking for a thoughtful gift that combines style and everyday functionality? Our Executive Men’s Gift Set is carefully curated for gentlemen who appreciate refined accessories and polished presentation.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFeaturing a sleek men’s belt, an elegant writing pen, and a classic wallet, this gift box is designed to complement both professional and casual wardrobes. Whether he’s heading to the office, attending an important meeting, or dressing for a special occasion, these timeless essentials add confidence and sophistication to his daily routine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeautifully packaged and ready to gift, this set is ideal for celebrating milestones, expressing appreciation, or simply treating someone special.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGift Set Includes:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E✔ Men’s Belt\u003Cbr /\u003E\n✔ Executive Ballpoint Pen\u003Cbr /\u003E\n✔ Classic Leather Wallet\u003Cbr /\u003E\n✔ Elegant Gift Box Presentation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhy He’ll Love It:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPractical accessories he can use every day\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ESophisticated and professional appearance\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ESuitable for business and formal occasions\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EThoughtfully curated gift collection\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EStylish presentation box\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EVersatile gift for men of all ages\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerfect For:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBirthday gifts for men\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EFather’s Day gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ECorporate gifting\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EStaff appreciation gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPromotion celebrations\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ERetirement gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAnniversary gifts for husbands\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u