        "short_description": "\u003Cp\u003ELuxury men’s wallet and executive pen gift set presented in a premium gift box. Perfect for birthdays, Father’s Day, anniversaries, corporate gifting, graduations, and special occasions. A sophisticated gift for him.\u003C/p\u003E",
        "description": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003ELooking for a sophisticated gift that combines elegance, practicality, and timeless style? Our Simple Men’s Wallet &amp; Executive Pen Gift Set is the perfect choice for the modern gentleman. Beautifully presented in a plastic portable gift box, this stylish set features a sleek leather wallet and an executive ballpoint pen designed to complement both professional and everyday lifestyles.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe premium wallet offers a refined look while providing convenient storage for cards, cash, and essentials, while the elegant pen adds a touch of class to meetings, office work, and personal use. Together, they create a thoughtful gift that is both functional and memorable.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhether you’re celebrating a birthday, Father’s Day, anniversary, graduation, promotion, retirement, or corporate milestone, this luxury gift set is guaranteed to impress. Ideal for husbands, fathers, boyfriends, brothers, colleagues, executives, and business professionals.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhy He’ll Love It:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E✔ Premium leather wallet with a sleek, professional finish\u003Cbr /\u003E\n✔ Elegant executive pen for work and everyday use\u003Cbr /\u003E\n✔ Luxury presentation gift box included\u003Cbr /\u003E\n✔ Practical, stylish, and sophisticated gift choice\u003Cbr /\u003E\n✔ Suitable for business professionals and modern gentlemen\u003Cbr /\u003E\n✔ Perfect combination of fashion and functionality\u003Cbr /\u003E\n✔ Ready-to-gift packaging for special occasions\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerfect For:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBirthday gifts for men\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EFather’s Day gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ECorporate and executive gifting\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAnniversary gifts for him\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EGraduation gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ERetirement gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAppreciation gifts for colleagues and mentors\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EChristmas gifts for husbands and fathers\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA timeless gift set designed to leave a lasting impression and elevate everyday essentials.\u003C/p\u003E",
