        "permalink": "https://giftsbysisi.com/product/personalized-cool-dad-sweatshirt/",
        "sku": "",
        "short_description": "\u003Cp\u003EPersonalized Cool Dad sweatshirt featuring custom names on the sleeve. A thoughtful Father’s Day, birthday, or Christmas gift for dads. Available in sizes S–XXL and perfect for everyday wear.\u003C/p\u003E",
        "description": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003ECelebrate Dad in style with our Personalized Cool Dad Sweatshirt, a thoughtful and fashionable gift designed for the dad who wears his heart on his sleeve &#8211; literally. Featuring the heartwarming message “This Cool Dad Wears His Heart On His Sleeve” and customizable sleeve details with children’s names, this premium crewneck sweatshirt is a meaningful keepsake he’ll cherish for years.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMade from soft, comfortable fabric with a relaxed fit, this sweatshirt is perfect for everyday wear, family outings, weekend relaxation, travel, and casual occasions. The timeless navy design makes it easy to pair with jeans, joggers, or casual trousers, while the personalized sleeve detail transforms it into a one-of-a-kind gift.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhether you’re celebrating Father’s Day, a birthday, Christmas, a new dad milestone, or simply showing appreciation, this custom sweatshirt is a heartfelt way to remind Dad how much he means to his family.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhy Dad Will Love It:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPersonalized sleeve with children’s names\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMeaningful “Cool Dad” design\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ESoft, comfortable, and durable fabric\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EClassic crewneck style for everyday wear\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPerfect balance of style and sentiment\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAvailable in sizes S, M, L, XL, and XXL\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EGreat for casual wear, family events, and special occasions\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EUnique keepsake gift that celebrates fatherhood\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerfect For:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EFather’s Day gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBirthday gifts for dad\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ENew dad gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EChristmas gifts for fathers\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EHusband gifts from wife and children\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPersonalized family gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAppreciation gifts for dads and father figures\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGive Dad a gift that keeps his loved ones close wherever he goes with this stylish and sentimental personalized sweatshirt.\u003C/p\u003E",
