        "description": "\u003Cp data-rm-block-id=\"block-1\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003EAdd humor, and sporty vibes to any space with our “I Beat People With A Stick” Funny Pool Player Throw Pillow — the perfect statement piece for billiards lovers and game room enthusiasts. Designed for pool sharks who love a good laugh, this stylish 16”x16” decorative cushion makes a unique gift for birthdays, Father’s Day, game nights, housewarming celebrations, or just because.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp data-rm-block-id=\"block-2\"\u003ECrafted with premium-quality materials and bold high-definition printing, this pillow instantly upgrades sofas, lounge areas, bedrooms, offices, man caves, and entertainment spaces. Its modern black design with billiard graphics creates a fun yet classy décor accent that stands out beautifully.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp data-rm-block-id=\"block-3\"\u003EWant to make it extra special?\u003Cbr /\u003E\nYou can personalize the back of the pillow with the receiver’s name at an additional cost — making it a thoughtful and memorable custom gift.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp data-rm-block-id=\"block-4\"\u003EWhy You’ll Love It:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli data-rm-block-id=\"block-5\"\u003EPremium-quality decorative throw pillow\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-rm-block-id=\"block-6\"\u003EFunny billiards-themed design for pool lovers\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-rm-block-id=\"block-7\"\u003EPerfect gift for men, dads, husbands, friends, and game enthusiasts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-rm-block-id=\"block-8\"\u003EIdeal for living rooms, game rooms, lounges, and offices\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-rm-block-id=\"block-9\"\u003ESoft, durable, and comfortable material\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-rm-block-id=\"block-10\"\u003EVibrant long-lasting print quality\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-rm-block-id=\"block-11\"\u003ESize: 16” x 16”\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-rm-block-id=\"block-12\"\u003EOptional custom name personalization on the back (extra cost applies)\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp data-rm-block-id=\"block-13\"\u003EWhether you’re shopping for a pool player, decorating a gaming space, or looking for a hilarious conversation starter, this pillow delivers comfort, style, and personality all in one.\u003C/p\u003E",
