        "description": "\u003Cp\u003ELooking for a thoughtful, elegant gift that feels personal and refreshing? This beautifully curated Relax &amp; Refresh Gift Box is designed to deliver comfort, care, and a touch of everyday luxury.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerfect for birthdays, appreciation gifts, get-well-soon surprises, or “just because” moments, this hamper blends wellness, sweetness, and style into one unforgettable experience.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E✨ What’s Inside:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EA selection of fresh, juicy fruits (apples &amp; grapes) for a healthy touch\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPremium fruit-infused tea for relaxation moments\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EDelicious shortbread biscuits for a sweet treat\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EA stylish ceramic mug for cozy sipping\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAn inspiring “Great Ideas” notebook for creativity and journaling\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E💝 Why This Gift Stands Out:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ECombines health + indulgence in one package\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EThoughtfully arranged for a luxury unboxing experience\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EIdeal for women, colleagues, friends, and loved ones\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPerfect for self-care, appreciation, and wellness gifting\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E🎯 Whether you’re sending love from afar or celebrating someone special, this box says “I see you, I appreciate you, and you deserve this moment.”\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cem\u003E📌 Important Note:\u003C/em\u003E\u003Cbr /\u003E\n\u003Cem\u003EEach gift box is carefully curated with attention to quality and presentation. However, in the rare case that any item is out of stock, it may be replaced with a similar or higher-value product that matches the overall theme and quality of the package.\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
