        "permalink": "https://giftsbysisi.com/product/luxury-mothers-day-gift-box-for-mom/",
        "sku": "",
        "short_description": "",
        "description": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003ECelebrate the woman who means everything with the Love You Mom Luxury Gift Box — a thoughtfully curated gift designed to make every mother feel cherished, appreciated, and pampered.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis elegant gift set combines comfort, self-care, and heartfelt sentiment, making it the perfect surprise for birthdays, Mother’s Day, appreciation moments, or simply to say “thank you for everything.”\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInside this beautifully arranged box, she’ll discover a cozy decorative pillow that celebrates motherhood in every language of love, indulgent body care for a relaxing self-care moment, and a refreshing energy tea to brighten her day.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery detail is designed to create a warm, emotional gifting experience she’ll remember long after the box is opened.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhat’s Inside\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E• Motherhood Celebration Cushion – A stylish decorative pillow featuring the words Mother, Mama, Mommy, Madre, Mom\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E• Strawberry Soufflé Shower Gel – A sweet, refreshing fragrance for everyday confidence\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E• Luxury Bath &amp; Body Treat – For a relaxing self-care moment\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E• Energy Boost Herbal Tea – A revitalizing tea blend to refresh and energize\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E• Premium Gift Packaging – Beautifully arranged and ready to gift\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E• Complimentary Greeting Card – Add your personalized message inside it at no extra cost\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerfect For\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMother’s Day gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBirthday gifts for mom\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAppreciation gifts for mothers\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ENew mom gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EThoughtful self-care gift sets\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGive her a moment of comfort, love, and relaxation with a gift box that truly says “You are appreciated.”\u003C/p\u003E",
