        "description": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003ESlip into effortless comfort with this Cozy Lounge Set; where softness meets simple elegance. This two-piece set features a relaxed-fit top and matching shorts in a calming grey tone, finished with delicate dotted details for a subtle, playful charm.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMade for slow mornings, self-care evenings, and cozy weekends, it feels gentle on the skin and breathable enough for all-day wear. The elastic-waist shorts offer a flexible fit, while the loose top drapes beautifully for a flattering, laid-back look.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhether you’re gifting a loved one or treating yourself, this set delivers comfort, style, and that “ahh” feeling the moment you put it on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerfect for:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ERelaxing at home\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ETravel &amp; staycations\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EThoughtful comfort gifts\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EStylish sleepwear\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E✨ Comfort never looked this cute.\u003C/p\u003E",
